Fix Missing Icons in Manjaro LXQt
	1. Install Recommended Icon Themes

	LXQt needs complete icon sets. Try installing oxygen, breeze, or papirus:

		sudo pacman -S papirus-icon-theme oxygen breeze-icons

	Then logout and login again.


	2. Set Icon Theme in LXQt Appearance

	Go to:

		Preferences → LXQt settings → Appearance → Icons tab

	Choose a complete icon set like:

		    Papirus

		    Breeze

		    Oxygen

	Then click Apply.